## 1\. Requirement: Void Pre-Authorization Filtering (Suppression)

**Goal:** Prevent a Reversal/Void of an original **Pre-Authorization (MTI 100)** from being written to the TC57 file, while allowing Reversals/Voids of **Settled Transactions (MTI 200/Completion)** to proceed.

This requires a database lookup to determine the original transaction's MTI, using the original trace number.

